x-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"E\n\\vdash \\neg\\mathrm{UC}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D438 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22A2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c55\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">UC</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, with the bounded rules of Section\n6.1.</p>","file":"ch6/uniform-continuity-rule-by-rule.html"}